    "chunk_text": "\u2022 To provide equal access to every student, this competition will be held under three school categories (40/2025). \u2022 The number of students is less than 200. \u2022 Between 201-500 \u2022 Over 500\n\n\u2022 Winning students in each of these categories will be evaluated at the national level.\n\n\u2022 Continuous supervision of Provincial Special Coordinating Officers to implement subject development programmes at the provincial level.\n\nRegarding the Tamil language\n\n\u2022 Preparation of model question papers and answer schemes for students of G.C.E. (O/L) Examination and their publication through the Ministry of Education\u2019s e-Thaksalawa platform are being carried out.\n\n\u2022 Conducting workshops for teachers teaching for G.C.E. (Ordinary Level) Exam at both provincial and national levels.\n\n\u2022 Conducting workshops for students.\n\n\u2022 Conducting the educational programme \u201cGurugedara\u201d in collaboration with the NIE.\n\nFuture Plans\n\n\u2022 Taking measures to promote reading habits among students.\n\nExamples: Establishing classroom libraries and increasing the use of school libraries.\n\n\u2022 Conducting oral examinations and awarding high-quality, appropriate books as prizes to students.\n\n\u2022 Implementing activity-based workshops for teacher advisers.\n\n\u2022 Implementing skills-based competitions in Tamil Language Day programmes.\n\nRegarding the English language\n\n01. Taking steps to improve the quality of language education through capacity-development programmes for English and foreign language teachers.\n\n\u2022 To create an English-speaking environment for students in primary grades 1 and 2, and to introduce programmes to develop the English-speaking skills of primary teachers.\n\nEg :- Strengthen Primary English at Key Stage 1 - SPEAK\n\n\u2022 Implementing programmes on learning\n\nmethodologies to strengthen the learning and teaching process of English teachers through Regional English Support Centres established in all provinces.\n\nFor example: - One-year course in strengthening the Teaching methods for primary English teachers."
