    "chunk_text": "The draft of the Katana Development Plan (2024-2033) prepared, covering the above areas of jurisdiction has received the approval of the Principal Planning Committee of the Urban Development Authority on 16.11.2023. At present, it has been referred to the relevant local authorities and the Katana Divisional Coordinating Committee to obtain their observations and recommendations.\n\nNegombo Municipal Council\n\nGampaha Municipal Council\n\nThe Gampaha Development Plan (2024-2033) for the above area of jurisdiction has been published via Extraordinary Gazette dated 12.06.2024 and had been legally brought into operation.\n\n(iii) Yes. Annex 01*: Ja-Ela Draft Zoning Plan Annex 02*: Minuwangoda Draft Zoning Plan The draft of the Katana Development Plan (2024-2033) can be accessed through the following official website: https://motherlanka.uda.lk/\n\n245 246\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0db4\u0dd4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dcf\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0db8\u0dad \u0dcf\u0db3\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dcf. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0bae\u0bc8\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0bae\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0db4\u0dd4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dcf\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0db8\u0dad \u0dcf\u0db3\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dcf. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0bae\u0bc8\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0bae\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0daf\u0dda\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dd9\n\nThe Negombo Development Plan (2021-2030) can be accessed through the following official website:\n\nhttps://www.uda.gov.lk/applicable_dev_plans.html\n\nThe Gampaha Development Plan (2024-2033) can be accessed through the following official website:\n\nhttps://www.uda.gov.lk/applicable_dev_plans.html\n\n(iv) Yes. (Draft Katana Development Plan)\n\n(v) The draft of the Katana Development Plan\n\n(2024-2033) received approval from the Principal Planning Committee of the Urban Development Authority on 16.11.2023. It had now been submitted to the Katunayake-Seeduwa Urban Council, the Katana Pradeshiya Sabha, and the Katana Divisional Coordinating Committee for obtaining observations and recommendations.\n\nAll these development plans have been planned by the Urban Development Authority with the active participation of the relevant line agencies and stakeholder institutions.\n\n(vi) Yes."
