    "chunk_text": "By the year 2013, as a result of the development programmes implemented under the contribution and guidance of the Ministry of Agriculture, the country achieved self-sufficiency in rice and was able to produce the major portion of the domestic maize requirement. Furthermore,\n\nIn 2014, home gardening programmes, fruit sapling distribution programmes and protected house (greenhouse) construction projects were carried out to increase the crop cultivation area for the agricultural advancement of the country.\n\nIn the year 2018, various programmes had been implemented to increase production in anticipation of progress relating to the above criteria, including home gardening programmes and to prevent production from declining.\n\nDuring the year 2019, programmes had been implemented to increase the water capacity of irrigation systems to easily contribute toward maintaining uninterrupted food production.\n\nIn the year 2022, programmes had been implemented to promote home gardening to increase the area under cultivation.\n\nIn the years 2023 and 2024, various agricultural programmes were implemented within selected villages to attract young farming communities to agriculture and improve their economic status/increase their income.\n\n(vi) Adverse weather impacts such as floods and droughts, naturally spreading pest infestations, damage caused by wild animals and fluctuations in energy prices.\n\n(b) Not applicable.\n\n987 988\n\n\u0dc3\u0dd0.\u0dba\u0dd4.\n\n\u0d9c\u0db8\u0db8 \u0dc0\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0d9c\u0dda \u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db1 \u0db8\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dab\u0dba \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dc4\u0dcf \u0dc3\u0d85\u0dc0\u0d9a\u0dd3\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dbd \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dd0\u0dbb\u0daf\u0dd2 \u0d9a\u0dc5 \u0dad\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0dcf\u0dd0\u0dca :\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dd2\u0dd2\u0db1 \u0db8\u0dca \u0dd3\u0dca \u0dd2\u0dca \u0db4\u0dd2\u0dd4\u0db4\u0dcf\u0d9a\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0db1\n\n\u0db