    "chunk_text": "months from the 27th of February to the 27th of September before completing his term. Thereafter, there will be a lady Chief Justice, Justice B.V. Nagarathna. She will be there as the Chief Justice only for 36 days. So, they promote people according to their seniority; there is no picking and choosing by the President. And, it must also be pointed out that consulting the Chief Justice happens only when it comes to the Constitutional Council. It is the Constitutional Council which has to routinely get the opinion of the Chief Justice about the suitability of the candidates. Now, what is happening invariably is, there is serious interference with the Judiciary and its functions by holding on and not making those appointments in time.\n\nThere was also mention about the Divineguma Act. Even at that time, the then Minister in charge consulted the provincial councils. Of course, they tried to bring pressure on people and then, convert them and get their consent by force. But here, what is happening is this. Since the provincial councils are not functioning, you could, at least, get the consent of the Governors. But, all that has been overlooked and you are bringing in this Act against the provisions of the Constitution; this is clearly in violation of Article 154G of the Constitution. Therefore, our party will be opposing the enactment of this Bill.\n\nThank you. \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd6\u0daa \u0dd9\u0db1\u0dca\u0dd3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bb2\u0b95\u0bae\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b89\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Presiding Member) \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d85\u0dd6 \u0db6\u0d9a\u0dbb\u0dca \u0d85\u0dca\u0dda\u0db6\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf \u0dca \u0dad\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dca\u0dcf0 \u0d94\u0db6\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dca\u0dcf\u0da7 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dcf\u0da9\u0dd2 7\u0d9a \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dca \u0dba\u0dda \u0db6\u0db1\u0dc0\u0dcf0\n\n[\u0baa\u0bbf.\u0baa. 2.37]"
