    "chunk_text": "Jaffna. Actually, I met the official Bar there. I was very honoured to have Mr. Sumanthiran also seated with me till the end of it. Yes, they also did inquire about Chemmani. Actually, what I learnt when I went to the Chemmani mass graves, Hon. Member, and spoke with Prof. Raj Somadeva and the team was that, now, they are in the excavation and exhumation stage and that there is another stage we have to go to - processing. So, what I did ask them was, without waiting for the complete excavation to be over, whether it is possible to start the second and the third stages, for which they could not give me an answer then and there. But, they - the JMOs and the anthropologists, including the leader of the team, Prof. Raj Somadeva - agreed to have discussions. What I inquired was, without waiting till one stage is over, whether we could go for the other stages. So, that will be discussed; in fact, I am the one who suggested that and they said they are willing to discuss that.\n\n(h) Investigations are taking place under the jurisdiction of the Jaffna Magistrate\u2019s Court and we are committed to supporting the court, the tracing and investigation team and the OMP to establish the truth regarding the site of Chemmani.\n\nObviously, one of the reasons for my visit was to make sure that things are functioning smoothly and that funds are available because we cannot drag this on forever. But, only when I saw how the investigations are being carried out painstakingly with little brushes and everything that I realized how complicated this job could be. As much as myself, my Government, even you as a Representative and the people are in a rush and a hurry to find things out and I also do understand that time is taken, but I can assure you that the truth will be found, it will be dealt with and that our Government has no business in covering anything up. - [Interruption.]\n\n1253 1254\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd3\u0dd2\u0dba\u0da5 \u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd \u0db1\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf \u0dca\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbb \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dca\u200d\u0dcf]\n\n2026 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dd2 25"
  },
