    "chunk_size_bytes": 1004,
    "chunk_text": "Accordingly, in monetary policy deliberations and arriving at monetary policy decisions, the Central Bank would take into account the broader economic conditions such as economic growth, employment, developments in the external sector and financial system stability. While the Central Bank may consider such broader economic conditions when formulating policy, the Central Bank Act does not explicitly set statutory targets for these macroeconomic variables.\n\nAccordingly, the Central Bank uses the most recently rebased official CCPI series available for monetary policy analysis and decision-making. As per available information, a new round of the HIES is currently underway and the CPI base year and weights will be updated accordingly.\n\nThank you. \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u200d \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Speaker) Hon. Ravi Karunanayake, you may seek a clarification now."
