    "chunk_size_bytes": 1721,
    "chunk_text": "[5.15 p.m.] \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dcf\u0db0\u0dd2\u0db4\u0dd2\u0db1 \u0db1\u0dd3\u0dd2\u0db1\u0da5 \u0dc6\u0dd2 \u0dca\u0dcf \u0db8\u0dd4\u0dca\u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dcf \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dca\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0ba9\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0baa\u0ba4\u0bbf \u0b9a\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bb0\u0ba3\u0bbf \u0b95\u0baa\u0bb8\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0bae\u0bc1\u0bb8\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0baa\u0bbe) (The Hon. Faiszer Musthapha, PC) I am thankful, Hon. Presiding Member, that I have been given an opportunity to speak a few words.\n\nEvery day, we confiscate large amounts of drugs. Here, I would also like to thank former President Maithripala Sirisena. During his tenure, he started the war against drug abuse. And, you all have continued it well; you also have brought back drug dealers hiding in other countries, which further strengthens the cause. Since, the Minister of Public Security and Parliamentary Affairs is here, I would like to draw his attention to a certain issues. If you take the United States or the UK, there is a legal framework under which the law enforcement officials\n\n1361 1362\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db0\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0db8\u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2 \u0daf\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dca\u200d\u0dcf]\n\n2026 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dd2 25\n\npretend to be part of the drug cartels, infiltrate those organizations and go to the source. Unfortunately, Hon. Minister, we do not have such a mechanism. So, I would ask you to look at other jurisdictions where the law enforcement officers pretend to be drug lords, infiltrate the drug mafia and then go to the source. Until we have such a legal framework, we would not be able to go the source. Therefore, the Minister could look into it and we could appoint a Select Committee specifically to look at establishing such a legal mechanism through which we could penetrate the drug cartels. All over the world, they have succeeded by penetrating the drug cartels."
